    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Approachable practitioners praised for detailed consultations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the clinical team for their warmth, expertise, and consistent attentiveness. Reviewers highlight Dr. Hildenbrand, Dr. Denton, and Dr. Lee for taking time to explain complex medical decisions without rigidity and remembering pets across multiple visits. While several negative reviews cite interpersonal frustration or perceived arrogance, the prevailing sentiment describes a kind and capable staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calming pheromones and compassionate physical examinations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report that veterinarians and veterinary technicians handle animals with notable patience and gentleness. Reviewers mention that the clinic uses comforting measures, such as spraying synthetic pheromones, to help anxious cats and dogs relax during appointments. Owners of medically complex senior pets express deep gratitude for the supportive care their companions receive during checkups and exams."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective senior care amid diagnostic disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clinical results and diagnostic outcomes show a negative balance among recent reviews. While multiple pet owners describe excellent ongoing management for senior animals and successful emergency care for suspected poisoning, other clients report severe diagnostic disappointments. Unfavorable reviews describe missed skin conditions, unexplained scabs following visits, and delayed identification of critical feline illness."
      }
    }
  ],
